    {
      "id": "claim_1f9390161fa0451ab168f384ebbe7d4e",
      "statement": "The bare openwiki CLI must never be invoked directly on this repo; it omits the telemetry opt-out env var (OPENWIKI_TELEMETRY_DISABLED=1) and the raised Node heap size that the pnpm nx wiki-update infrastructure-as-code Nx target sets, causing reliable OOM failures.",
      "evidence": [
