    {
      "id": "claim_bda4089fc528402e8bc23e8c991dcb69",
      "statement": "The wiki-maintain job's guard forbids resolving the generator fresh at run time: it rejects an `npm install -g`, an `npx ... openwiki`, a `pnpm add`/`pnpm dlx`, or an `npm install ... openwiki` in the workflow's command lines, requires the locked binary at tools/openwiki-generator/node_modules/.bin to be placed first on $GITHUB_PATH with a `command -v openwiki` check so a global on the runner's PATH cannot stand in, and requires the installed-generator checks to read the locked install through OPENWIKI_ROOT. That verify step also fails on a SKIP, not only on a failure, because the pinned-version assertions skip wherever the pinned generator is not installed (every other guardrail job) and a skipped check reads as a pass.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://.forgejo/workflows/wiki-maintain.yml#L154-L182",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:cf5d943dd052195690fae3dfc0c6bd8b1b8133d19c063c1efde9f521c9d93759:"
        },
        {
