    {
      "id": "claim_566c14be0da7436aa96ee846c28b4af0",
      "statement": "The root pnpm-workspace.yaml deliberately sets no `minimumReleaseAge`: a pnpm-level cooldown there BREAKS cold `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` in the BFF/agent Docker builds and CI, because on an empty store pnpm fetches registry metadata and rejects any pinned dependency published younger than the threshold, and a frozen install cannot re-resolve to an older version. That is why the generator's cooldown can exist only in tools/openwiki-generator, which is its own workspace root and therefore does not inherit the root's settings or lockfile.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://pnpm-workspace.yaml#L1-L3",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3951190890640acf9b093aa7569d3fe3324b04a1852042a33f696afe2b03fedc:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://pnpm-workspace.yaml#L116-L121",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e3eff0c9e946130cc36ae7b1263c08e3497bcaac17d68b90bfad5d7c270d889c:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://tools/openwiki-generator/pnpm-workspace.yaml#L1-L12",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:609c4290e801c8fb5dda4fdb905b25bc05476424c477dda5228a76f94a4ef462:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_a80833ed8e334468b2cac3615faf562d",
      "statement": "The generator's manifest and lockfile are checked against each other offline, so a manifest edited without regenerating pnpm-lock.yaml fails a guardrail job instead of surfacing only on the paid runner: tools/openwiki-generator/package.json must declare exactly jsdom, mermaid and openwiki, each as an exact x.y.z version with no range, and the lockfile importer's specifier and resolution for each must equal the manifest.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://scripts/__tests__/wiki-maintain.guard.test.mjs#L217-L233",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:8f2d2473976a61cd22f4a7a7381ad623c4b1dfc6f5104e3005e33bdea746c424:"
