    {
      "id": "claim_aa12424f9bd640b6907601cdad8908c4",
      "statement": "tools/openwiki-generator/pnpm-workspace.yaml allows exactly one dependency install script, `better-sqlite3`, because openwiki's LangGraph checkpointer loads that package's native binding at run time and its install script already ran under the previous `npm install -g`; every other package's build script stays denied, and pnpm 11 fails an undecided one.",
