    },
    {
      "id": "claim_9ad6ea435b0142b089f1a5983b6bc600",
      "statement": "No `minimumReleaseAgeExclude` entry is currently in force in the generator's workspace: the last one, `@azure/identity@4.14.1`, was removed once it cleared the three-day window. The two security floors the file retains are `body-parser@>=2.0.0 <2.4.0` floored to `>=2.4.0 <3` (GHSA-27r3-jxmh-p828) and `@azure/identity@<4.14.1` floored to `>=4.14.1 <5` (GHSA-xcx6-jx8p-x3h5), both repeated by hand because the root's `overrides:` map does not reach this directory.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://tools/openwiki-generator/pnpm-workspace.yaml#L27-L44",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:607f453f8d70408f1aa038cbdd53147d65981a5cea143418b491de0581d8d7ed:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_d803e10275e545aaa53df3b27103e361",
      "statement": "The host-install snippet in docs/runbooks/dev-environment-setup.md §6a still pins `openwiki@0.5.2`, two minor versions behind the `openwiki@0.7.1` that .devcontainer/toolchain.Dockerfile and CI install, so copying it reproduces exactly the host/container version skew the generator parity guard exists to prevent; the authoritative pin is the toolchain Dockerfile.",
